                {
                  "text": "Ezekieli 17:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona Zedekiya waasi mfalume Nebukadineza, ambapho kala akaapa kukala andaishimu Mwenyezi Mlungu. Ela Zedekiya kala ni mutu wa moyo mufu, warema kulunga Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu a Juda na hata alavyadzi-sadaka ambao kala ni akulu ao, akosera Mlungu sana na achihenda mambo ga kutsukiza sawa-sawa na mataifa. Nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu aitiya najisi dzagbwe Mlungu kala akaitakasa hiko Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mwenyezi Mlungu waonera atue mbazi na badala ya kubananga iyo Nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu, wahuma manabii kano kpwa kano kpwendaaonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hinyo atu aatseka na kuanyetera hinyo ahumwa a Mlungu. Aenderera kubera maneno ga Mwenyezi Mlungu hadi achimtsukiza na ichikala taphana budi kuatiya adabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
