          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mwaka wa kpwandza wa utawala wa mfalume Koreshi wa Pashia, ili neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu rogombwa ni nabii Jeremia ritimiye, Mwenyezi Mlungu wamuhenda Koreshi mfalume wa Pashia aandike tangazo na ritangazwe kahi za ufalumewe wosi. Tangazo renye kala rinaamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
